<title>CHILE: Chile's Escondida Nov copper output climbs.</title>
<headline>Chile's Escondida Nov copper output climbs.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chile's Minera Escondida Limitada reported the following copper and gold production figures for November.</p>
<p>COPPER (metric tonnes)     Nov 96	Oct 96     Nov 95</p>
<p>Copper in concentrates     54,624	68,083     29,588</p>
<p>Copper cathodes		 5,124	 3,706	2,065</p>
<p>Total			    59,748	71,789     31,653</p>
<p>				January-Nov 1996   January-Nov 1995</p>
<p>Total				760,146	    423,663</p>
<p>				    Nov 1996	  Nov 1995</p>
<p>GOLD (ounces)		     13,626	     7,555</p>
<p>NOTE: Minera Escondida is owned by Broken Hill Proprietary and RTZ Corp plc.</p>
<p>-- Margaret Orgill, Santiago newsroom, 562-699-5595x212</p>
</text>
